; Cost model for PULP Xpulpv2 packed SIMD (v2i16 and v4i8 held in one GPR, no
; RVV), as the loop and SLP vectorizers see it (backlog B156, task 20/F055).
; The numbers follow what llc selects for these operations: one pv.*
; instruction for the packed operations, lane-by-lane code (pv.extract, a
; scalar operation per lane, pv.pack) for what the instruction set lacks.
; GAP9 enables unaligned-scalar-mem (20/F052); without it an under-aligned
; packed access is split into byte or halfword accesses.
; RUN: opt < %s -passes="print<cost-model>" 2>&1 -disable-output -mtriple=riscv32 -mattr=+m,+xgap,+unaligned-scalar-mem | FileCheck %s --check-prefixes=CHECK,UNALIGNED
; RUN: opt < %s -passes="print<cost-model>" 2>&1 -disable-output -mtriple=riscv32 -mattr=+m,+xpulpv | FileCheck %s --check-prefixes=CHECK,ALIGNED

